  "name": "Audio Analyzer",
  "description": "Audio Analyzer is a Java 21 research and engineering platform for reproducible audio experimentation and versioned digital signal processing workflows. It combines a desktop signal workbench, a collaborative browser-based workflow editor, deterministic domain models, recording and replay, evidence export, semantic history, versioned checkpoints, and an explicitly experimental acoustic-localization module.",
